# Agents may build

From the **mview** repo root:

```bat
.\build.bat
.\build.bat debug
.\build.bat debug base_widget
.\build.bat <single_target>
```

`build.bat` runs `gn gen` into **`out/Debug`** and **`out/Release`**, then `ninja`. Alias `m` is the product group (`default` / `base_widget`). `sln` is rejected.

## Do

- Prefer `build.bat debug <target>` when iterating.
- Partition parallel agents by **non-overlapping paths**. There is **no** compile lock.

## Don’t

- Don’t run `gen.bat`, `gen-dll.bat`, or MSBuild as the fix loop.
- Don’t create `out/.build.lock.on` or set `SMARTGIS_BUILD_LOCK`.
- Don’t use bare `out/` or `out/Default` as a gen root.
- Don’t retarget the tree to smartgis `//src` targets (`te`, `harness`, `SmartGIS.exe`). Those are not in this repo.
